            "en": "E1:\n+2 Reload on Bombardment prep, not important\nE2:\nAllows Targetting of Ballistas technically, also damage increase\nE3:\nMaking another Ballista is actually pretty great damage\nE4:\nAnother Max Reload is very good\nE5:\nPotential levels are good since Veronica has very high multipliers and multiplicatives\nE6:\nFloral Scent now gives Mark too, its ok"
